Memnite
Ornithopter
Fishliver Oil
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Staff of the Ages
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite x2
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
